Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 10.10.2026: «фрейм Server Log сделаем более адаптовным. SVG иконка в левой позиции со стрелкой вправо, в правой - влево. Перемещение фрейма в другую сторону страницы, и запоминание позиции для определённой комнаты».

The dock's head has a button on its inner edge (first when the dock stands right, last when it stands left): Lucide's arrow-left-to-line on the right, arrow-right-to-line on the left, pointing where a click takes it; its tip says so. The side is kept for the room (yue2.logDockSide, {"create": "left", …}); the Artist stands left by default (1258), the other rooms right; a lifted frame still puts the log left (1240) and hides the button meanwhile. The Trainer's log (1298) follows the dock to the free side by itself.

Suite: 547/0 in the kitchen (the 1298 check waits after its last switch of rooms: DevTools said «Promise was collected»); pictures of both sides folded and open by tools/claude-dock-probe.mjs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
